@api = http://localhost:5100

### The catalogue, with availability. Start here: it shows every id you need below.
GET {{api}}/api/books

### Q1 - Most borrowed books. Expect The Hobbit 6/6, then Dune 6/5.
GET {{api}}/api/books/most-borrowed?limit=5

### Q1 in a window. The half-open window narrows Dune to 3 loans.
GET {{api}}/api/books/most-borrowed?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-02-01

### Q2 - Top borrowers in a time frame. `from` and `to` are required.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/top?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-04-01&limit=5

### Q2 with the upper bound moved one day. Elena's 1 April loan appears and she rises to 4/4.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/top?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-04-02&limit=5

### Q3 - Reading pace for Clara Diaz. Expect 115 pages per day: 1150 pages over 10 days.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/3/reading-pace

### Q3 for Ava in January. Two overlapping loans, not netted out: 820 over 10 days is 82.0.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/1/reading-pace?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-12

### Q3 for a member with nothing finished. `pagesPerDay` is null, not zero.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/4/reading-pace?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-07-01

### Q4 - What else did the borrowers of Dune borrow? Cohort of 5; The Hobbit first at 5/5.
GET {{api}}/api/books/2/also-borrowed?limit=3

### One title
GET {{api}}/api/books/1

### One borrower
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/3

### A window with no Content-Type is a 415, not a 400: the media type is the problem.
POST {{api}}/api/loans

### A negative limit reaches the service and is rejected there, with the cap named.
GET {{api}}/api/books/most-borrowed?limit=-1

### An empty window value means "absent", so this is the all-time report.
GET {{api}}/api/books/most-borrowed?from=&to=

### Borrow Neuromancer for Farid Haddad. Returns 201 and a Location that resolves.
POST {{api}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrowerId": 6, "bookId": 3 }

### Return that loan. Use the id from the response above.
POST {{api}}/api/loans/29/return

### Every copy is out: 409, not 400. The same request may succeed later.
POST {{api}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrowerId": 1, "bookId": 8 }

### A missing window on Q2: 400, and no call is made to the service.
GET {{api}}/api/borrowers/top

### Add a title and its copies
POST {{api}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "The Dispossessed", "author": "Ursula K. Le Guin", "pageCount": 350, "copies": 2 }

### Add a borrower
POST {{api}}/api/borrowers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Grace Hopper", "email": "grace.hopper@example.com" }

### Liveness. Answers even when the lending service is down.
GET {{api}}/health
